OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews tackle wood plant blaze
OL,4,Afor third day
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire crews are continuing to tackle a
OL,7,Flarge blaze at a North Yorkshire wood
OL,8,Frecycling plant for a third day.
OL,10,FNorth Yorkshire Fire & Rescue Service
OL,11,Fwas called to reports of a fire at the
OL,12,FSeras facility on Heck and Pollington
OL,13,FLane, near Great Heck, at 23:41 BST on
OL,14,FTuesday.
OL,16,FThe service said a number of fire
OL,17,Fengines and crews remained at the
OL,18,Fscene, and were expected to stay there
OL,19,Fthroughout the day.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
